&lt;li&gt;Lead Agile/Scrum execution, including writing epics and user stories, managing backlogs, and facilitating sprints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functional communication and manage stakeholder relationships across CPA&#39;s five pillars.&lt;/li&gt;
