&lt;li&gt;Direct the full systems development life cycle for various WIC applications and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the senior technical and operational point of contact from project inception through implementation and support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain technology strategies, roadmaps, governance procedures, and performance reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the availability, performance, security, and integration of supported applications and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee requirements analysis, solution architecture, development, testing, and operational readiness activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cybersecurity, data privacy, and compliance activities with internal and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and recommend technologies that improve service delivery, reliability, security, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead procurement, contract negotiation, and performance monitoring of vendor deliverables and budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain effective relationships with stakeholders and communicate technology status and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement process improvements and report on service quality and team effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with Department data security procedures and policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of eight years of experience with Oracle 12c SQL/PLSQL and related technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Six years of experience with cellular communication protocols and application development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two years of experience with IBM Cloud service offerings and Watson-based development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eight years of experience leading enterprise information systems and supporting technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Five years of experience managing technical staff and coordinating work across various disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Five years of experience directing full systems development life cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Five years of experience in strategic technology planning and compliance with regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Five years of experience managing vendor relationships and technology budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Five years of experience supporting high availability and transaction-based systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating complex technology matters to various stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of public sector IT governance and relevant legal and policy applications.&lt;/li&gt;
